#: ../../smart_case/user_guide.rst:7
msgid "This plugin adds a new scripting function ``$smart_case(text)`` to Capitalize The First Character In Every Word Of The Text. The conversion leaves words containing embedded uppercase as-is (i.e. USA or DoA)."
msgstr ""

