msgid "This plugin adds a new scripting function ``$smart_case(text)``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../smart_case/user_guide.rst:17
msgid "Usage: **$smart_case(text)**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../smart_case/user_guide.rst:19
msgid "This will return ``text`` converted to Capitalize The First Character In Every Word Of The Text. The conversion leaves words containing embedded uppercase as-is (i.e. USA or DoA)."
